  "description": "Fast-paced Arena Shooter\nDive into a fast-paced arena shooter where the controls are simple but the battles test your strategy!\n\nExplore dungeons filled with summoners who unleash waves of enemies, relentless attackers, \nand the fearsome “Phantom” that hunts you down without mercy.\n\nLevel up to boost your stats and grab equipment from treasure chests to strengthen your character. \nWith each upgrade offering random sets of three options, your character grows differently every time you play.\n\nChoose three party members before entering the dungeon.\nEach combination changes your active and passive skills, dramatically altering your tactics.\n\nClear all the challenges in each stage and defeat the mighty boss lurking in the depths of the dungeon!\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nA Game-Exclusive Story\nExperience a brand-new, fully voiced adventure that branches off from the early events of The Strongest Job Is Apparently Not a Hero or a Sage, but an Appraiser (Provisional)!.\n\nAfter parting ways with Emalia, Hibiki takes on jobs to earn money together with Lillian, Claude, and Vene.\nThe group sets out into a forest to collect materials for a quest—a forest where people have been mysteriously disappearing.\nSuddenly, they fall into a magical trap that whisks them away to a strange dungeon…\n\nWill Hibiki and the others be able to escape from the dungeon?\nAnd who is the mysterious girl they encounter within its depths?",
